OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy this
OL,6,Fevening and overnight with a few spots
OL,7,Fof light rain or drizzle. Mist and fog
OL,8,Fpatches forming in prone spots with
OL,9,Flight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FCloudy with some patchy light
OL,12,Frain and drizzle in the morning.
OL,13,FOutbreaks of rain will become more
OL,14,Fextensive through the afternoon,
OL,15,Fturning persistent and occasionally
OL,16,Fheavier later on.
